# T_SCRE: a save drops the note of a copy: item 1 copied and the copy
# saved with Enter, the list showing "Item 46 saved"; then an item opened,
# its Service tab shown and left, and the list showing no note.  Then
# the copy of item 2 saved after its Loans tab was opened and left.
# Last, the copy of item 3 given a category the server refuses, then
# left without saving: a save was sent, so the copy is kept, the list
# saying "Copied as item 48".
K CTRL-D
S COPY1
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ALT-C S
S SERVICE
K ESC ESC
S NONOTE
K DOWN CTRL-D
K ALT-C A ESC
S BACKL
K CTRL-S
S SAVED2
K DOWN CTRL-D CTRL-Y
T ZZZZ
K CTRL-S
S REFUSED
K ESC
T Y
S KEPT
K ESC
